     The ssgglliisstt__aappppeenndd__mmbbuuff__eeppgg function appends the physical address ranges
     described by the external multipage mbuf(9) buffer _e_x_t___p_g_s to the scat‐
     ter/gather list _s_g.  The physical address ranges start at offset _o_f_f_s_e_t
     within _e_x_t___p_g_s and continue for _l_e_n bytes.  Note that unlike
     ssgglliisstt__aappppeenndd__mmbbuuff, ssgglliisstt__aappppeenndd__mmbbuuff__eeppgg only adds ranges for a single
     mbuf, not an entire mbuf chain.

     The ssgglliisstt__aappppeenndd__mmbbuuff function appends the physical address ranges de‐
     scribed by an entire mbuf chain _m to the scatter/gather list _s_g.

     The ssgglliisstt__aappppeenndd__mmbbuuff function appends the physical address ranges de‐
